"Screenshot0.png", "id": "923876381907136", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974681_923876385240469_4132051384250922969_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6oZeHtE7pyAQ7kNvwGskq0c&_nc_oc=AdqK6iONhBufZu-SsqaFLME6GS4Mgb1Q7UDzu86q-r-al2r9wmCSVgttkkU0uSbVYVg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTopWnf8URloZ6ljDpC4qJJMAXnPmd78DDT3fMnZmWd-w&oe=6B06F9EC"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot1.png", "id": "5448030711940983", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982466_5448030718607649_6845811233407644525_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lss8yF832vwQ7kNvwF2hb2o&_nc_oc=AdrwrG-AG82OPsWTdzNN32ahzRcHdsQQk-DYOSzd2m93xmSq0gKvpQHuHbLm3mRayCE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRTu4JadrtxnD5PucXvmhkj7GV2laGSGDVtZsVpzZqC1w&oe=6B072480"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot2.png", "id": "1096947547603539", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974819_1096947550936872_6623262552815231899_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QzT5sA_NRRUQ7kNvwFyufd1&_nc_oc=AdqoKcyf5sxs5rPVcWxY8qQ40MN29etPcfb_R187igOSNXxcfIOjeZt0KUHd9rbtlIs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSK9tBf0pahStNagwF_YHHnB0cfcHPi0w3zIbmsod10fg&oe=6B07178D"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot3.png", "id": "492042612309514", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/86610702_492042615642847_8961521301303806226_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iogxw-2Q_p4Q7kNvwHNRA6D&_nc_oc=AdoX-_HqjeYIsvAF1xHKlW1dmmVo3fK6HTeLf4kkcGsjeg2W4lTpHakYKxNwGqT18MU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ_2P69rr_4V0O5AIBaFJ2ZZU9cvgOSS74__4YsYLXlnA&oe=6B07276C"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot4.png", "id": "831736571156653", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035344_831736577823319_3749544078509164249_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=950hLGhSRVUQ7kNvwEWCxH3&_nc_oc=AdoXtynicuGI7Po0spynR6q7ubuGqSCwJbiSFzRcmT5Rie63csuz1-kwT3eEnHKZ6S0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRYIBslS0oV31zDGayddfgZEoeQTCnhEmSXsFB6ezcx-g&oe=6B070AC2"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverLandscape.png", "id": "1443952479413837", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974677_1443952486080503_3476958366015208444_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QO3zXXYnRuUQ7kNvwEYKhHo&_nc_oc=AdojKjd9Kqh6a-sM3bDN9Ec2LCeLEU3RKrXOuaw91_OgLglLbQ2fJ53-U8ONYO2WttY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ_rhxj6VVkibS73km-4g-NZV1KQHlEHf7LuFkEesb2tg&oe=6B0715AF"}, "display_name": "3D scan of Collonges-la-Rouge", "keywords": ["photogrammetry", "reconstruction", "360camera", "digitization", "scan"], "long_description": "Move like a pedestrian in Collonges-la-Rouge, reconstructed from videos taken by two head-held 360 cameras (Gopro Max), whose trajectory is about 1.6km long.\n\nRight controller:\n- Rotate on the left or right by using the joystick\n- Update the vertical offset (up or down) by using the joystick\n- Choose a location and teleport to it by using the virtual laser pointer\n- Teleport by using the index trigger only if the laser is green (not red)\n\nLeft controller:\n- Move continuously by using the joystick\n- Switch pannel and map by using the grip/hand trigger\n- If both map and pannel are disabled, switch between rendering modes (texturing or normal colors) by pressing the index trigger\n- The map shows the cloud of mesh vertices and the user location\n- If the pannel is enabled, switch between constrained and unconstrained motions by pressing the index trigger\n- The constrained motion controls your height above the ground\n- The pannel shows information about the 3D model and the selected motion.\n", "short_description": "Move continuously like a pedestrian in a medieval town, which was computed by photogrammetry from cubemap videos (4096x1344x2) taken by two head-held 360 cameras (Gopro Max) and by walking about 1.6km in Collonges-la-Rouge (in France).\n"}]}, "developer_name": "Maxime Lhuillier", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://maximelhuillier.fr/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Unity 2019.4", "support_website_url": "http://maxime.lhuillier.free.fr/", "website_url": "https://maximelhuillier.fr/", "category": "ENTERTAINMENT", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "726368587961803"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["EXPLORATION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "8536874146334493"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001717_770726907467789_1893173778065304361_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KGr4LiNghWkQ7kNvwF46N4f&_nc_oc=AdpYJ27CWAhMHc6MWhMuWFz8pGgZ9Vyj4ROnJpLrV111I1LPl5h4YA_nnElOjwvchvY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSasL0bDdLr6PMgGtPSHHF0XWVpAWGQyIVZVuiuDJPBNQ&oe=6B070AC6"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "3D scan of Collonges-la-Rouge", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "APPS", "id": "362692211442873"}, "context_topics": [{"topic_name": "Travel & Exploration", "i